\",\"carrier\":\"UPS\"}\"\"\"),\n        ).andExpect(status().isCreated)\n\n        // Cancel the order\n        mockMvc.perform(post(\"/orders/O-4/cancel\"))\n            .andExpect(status().isOk)\n            .andExpect(jsonPath(\"$.orderId\").value(\"O-4\"))\n            .andExpect(jsonPath(\"$.status\").value(\"CANCELLED\"))\n\n        // Verify order is cancelled\n        mockMvc.perform(get(\"/orders/O-4\"))\n            .andExpect(status().isOk)\n            .andExpect(jsonPath(\"$.status\").value(\"CANCELLED\"))\n\n        // Verify shipments are cancelled\n        mockMvc.perform(get(\"/shipments/S-1\"))\n            .andExpect(status().isOk)\n            .andExpect(jsonPath(\"$.status\").value(\"CANCELLED\"))\n\n        mockMvc.perform(get(\"/shipments/S-2\"))\n            .andExpect(status().isOk)\n            .andExpect(jsonPath(\"$.status\").value(\"CANCELLED\"))\n    }\n\n    @Test\n    fun `cancelling an already cancelled order succeeds`() {\n        // Create and cancel an order\n        mockMvc.perform(createOrder(\"O-5\")).andExpect(status().isCreated)\n        mockMvc.perform(post(\"/orders/O-5/cancel\"))\n            .andExpect(status().isOk)\n            .andExpect(jsonPath(\"$.status\").value(\"CANCELLED\"))\n\n        // Cancel again - should succeed\n        mockMvc.perform(post(\"/orders/O-5/cancel\"))\n            .andExpect(status().isOk)\n            .andExpect(jsonPath(\"$.status\").value(\"CANCELLED\"))\n    }\n\n    @Test\n    fun `cancellation is blocked by a confirmed shipment`() {\n        // Create an order\n        mockMvc.perform(createOrder(\"O-6\")).andExpect(status().isCreated)\n\n        // Create a shipment and set it to CONFIRMED manually\n        shipmentRepository.save(\n            Shipment(\"S-3\", \"O-6\", \"DHL\", ShipmentStatus.CONFIRMED),\n        )\n\n        // Attempt to cancel - should fail\n        mockMvc.perform(post(\"/orders/O-6/cancel\"))\n            .andExpect(status().isConflict)\n            .andExpect(jsonPath(\"$.error.code\").value(\"ORDER_HAS_CONFIRMED_SHIPMENT\"))\n            .andExpect(jsonPath(\"$.error.message\").isNotEmpty)\n\n        // Verify order is still ACTIVE\n        mockMvc.perform(get(\"/orders/O-6\"))\n            .andExpect(status().isOk)\n            .andExpect(jsonPath(\"$.status\").value(\"ACTIVE\"))\n    }\n\n    @Test\n    fun `cancelling a non-existent order returns 404`() {\n        mockMvc.perform(post(\"/orders/does-not-exist/cancel\"))\n            .andExpect(status().isNotFound)\n            .andExpect(jsonPath(\"$.error.code\").value(\"ORDER_NOT_FOUND\"))\n            .andExpect(jsonPath(\"$.error.message\").isNotEmpty)\n    }\n}"},"caller":{"type":"direct"}}],"container":null,"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":8,"cache_creation_input_tokens":543,"cache_read_input_tokens":28276,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":543},"output_tokens":2,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"not_available"},"input_transformations":[],"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"1ba114ee-a78c-4c4d-b9e1-bc9febdbd24f","uuid":"1dcd13dd-7e04-4ff0-b47d-6c2e15d28c61","timestamp":"2026-09-30T15:39:49.943Z","request_id":"req_011CfZsjBG8nspYStsuswPtU","wire_tool_inputs":{"toolu_01D93KvoC2aM6ZHQPg91jixV":{"file_path":"/private/var/folders/jr/lwzz65cx5pndqqdgzhnym1pc0000gn/T/observatory-run-11951074-88d7-4aa3-862f-63290b23e206/sample-service/src/test/kotlin/com/unityinflow/sample/order/OrderControllerTest.kt","old_string":"    @Test\n    fun `returns 409 with the error envelope for a duplicate order id`() {\n        mockMvc.perform(createOrder(\"O-3\")).andExpect(status().isCreated)\n\n        mockMvc.perform(createOrder(\"O-3\"))\n            .andExpect(status().isConflict)\n            .andExpect(jsonPath(\"$.error.code\").value(\"ORDER_ALREADY_EXISTS\"))\n            .andExpect(jsonPath(\"$.error.message\").isNotEmpty)\n    