D\"))\n    }\n\n    @Test\n    fun `cancelling an already cancelled order succeeds`() {\n        // Create and cancel an order\n        mockMvc.perform(createOrder(\"O-5\")).andExpect(status().isCreated)\n        mockMvc.perform(post(\"/orders/O-5/cancel\"))\n            .andExpect(status().isOk)\n            .andExpect(jsonPath(\"$.status\").value(\"CANCELLED\"))\n\n        // Cancel again - should succeed\n        mockMvc.perform(post(\"/orders/O-5/cancel\"))\n            .andExpect(status().isOk)\n            .andExpect(jsonPath(\"$.status\").value(\"CANCELLED\"))\n    }\n\n    @Test\n    fun `cancellation is blocked by a confirmed shipment`() {\n        // Create an order\n        mockMvc.perform(createOrder(\"O-6\")).andExpect(status().isCreated)\n\n        // Create a shipment and set it to CONFIRMED manually\n        shipmentRepository.save(\n            Shipment(\"S-3\", \"O-6\", \"DHL\", ShipmentStatus.CONFIRMED),\n        )\n\n        // Attempt to cancel - should fail\n        mockMvc.perform(post(\"/orders/O-6/cancel\"))\n            .andExpect(status().isConflict)\n            .andExpect(jsonPath(\"$.error.code\").value(\"ORDER_HAS_CONFIRMED_SHIPMENT\"))\n            .andExpect(jsonPath(\"$.error.message\").isNotEmpty)\n\n        // Verify order is still ACTIVE\n        mockMvc.perform(get(\"/orders/O-6\"))\n            .andExpect(status().isOk)\n            .andExpect(jsonPath(\"$.status\").value(\"ACTIVE\"))\n    }\n\n    @Test\n    fun `cancelling a non-existent order returns 404`() {\n        mockMvc.perform(post(\"/orders/does-not-exist/cancel\"))\n            .andExpect(status().isNotFound)\n            .andExpect(jsonPath(\"$.error.code\").value(\"ORDER_NOT_FOUND\"))\n            .andExpect(jsonPath(\"$.error.message\").isNotEmpty)\n    }\n}"}}}
